messages:
Ravi: Quick follow-up from the streaming/chat postmortem 30m ago. We've seen repeated client timeouts and partial responses from the runtime. Need owners for short-term mitigations + medium-term protocol fixes.

Dana: I'll own the SDK changes (client reconnect/resume). Plan: 3 retries for transient errors (ECONNRESET, TIMEOUT, 499) with exp backoff + jitter, and add an optional Resume-Token header. Target PR: 2026-04-09.

Olga: I'll take server/runtime work. Short-term: enable SERVER_SMALL_CHUNKS flag and increase keepalive frequency. Medium-term: add an explicit trailing partial frame {"type":"partial_end","req":"<id>","cursor":"<cursor>"}. Design doc by 2026-03-31.

Marta: I'll own monitoring/runbook. Add metrics: partial_response_rate, resume_attempts, resume_success_rate, partial_frame_duration_ms. Alert: partial_response_rate > 0.5% for 10m. Runbook steps: flip SERVER_SMALL_CHUNKS, reduce gateway timeout 45s->30s, run synthetic test. Runbook draft by 2026-03-27.

Ravi: Short-term rollout today: Dana to add client retry shim, Olga to enable SERVER_SMALL_CHUNKS behind flag, Marta to add alert and synthetic. Confirm?

Dana: Confirmed. SDK will include compatibility shim so older servers ignore Resume-Token. Pseudocode:
```
if (stream.closed && err in [ECONNRESET, TIMEOUT, 499]) {
  for (i=1;i<=3;i++) {
    await sleep(expBackoff(i)+jitter());
    connect(headers={"Resume-Token": lastSeenToken});
    if (resumed) break;
  }
}
```

Olga: I'll push the flag and a quick telemetry probe to detect partial frames. Will add a server log when partial_end frames are emitted.

Marta: I'll create epic RT-4510 and link subs. Also adding a weekly incident-pattern review to catch recurrences.

Ravi: Ownership recap: Dana=SDK reconnect/resume + tests (PR 2026-04-09), Olga=server trailing frame + small_chunk flag (design 2026-03-31), Marta=monitoring + runbook + epic (2026-03-27). I'll coordinate cross-team updates and customer guidance.

Dana: I'll add integration tests that simulate partial frames + ECONNRESET to ensure resume works.

Olga: Also adding server-side explicit abort code for non-resumable closes so clients can decide no-retry.

Ravi: Good. Make sure API changelog and release notes mention the new trailing frame and Resume-Token.

PagerBot: Incident RT-4510 created and linked to the postmortem.

Marta: Posting JIRA links shortly. If anyone hits blockers, post here and I'll escalate. Reopening after the design review sync next Wed. :white_check_mark:
